Modifications: the Python implementations are being replaced by a native Zig
engine and a Bun/TypeScript OpenTUI client; a versioned NDJSON protocol, SQLite
state, download recovery, and mpv supervision are added. See
docs/upstream-baseline.md and docs/compatibility.md for the exact baseline and
behavioral status.

